  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/29c005a4650f334371fc8baa25d8b45535b2bddc82e02857dadf80e5f3dc2776.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tPhương trình đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và nhận  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> làm véc-tơ chỉ phương có phương trình tham số là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math><br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> cùng phương với véc-tơ pháp tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>27</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>162</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>27</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là điểm đối xứng của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>139</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>165</mn><mrow><mn>37</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math><br>Khi đó để <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ngắn nhất thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> thẳng hàng hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> là giao điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>139</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>165</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).",
